  "curation_notes": [
    "The brief names the key column `state`, the same word the golden uses and the word a journalist would write. An earlier draft renamed it to `jurisdiction` to hide that the name comes from the population table \u2014 but declaring a per-state output row is already most of that hint, so the rename bought nothing, and `jurisdiction` is the broader word and probably invited Guam and Puerto Rico into the first build's output.",
